  "bio": "Renowned for his immaculate minimalist and dotwork tattoos, Ramiz Lolas is a true master in his craft. His professionalism is evident in every piece of art he creates, ensuring that clients leave his studio, Beit Jala, with a timeless work of art on their skin. Ramiz's portfolio, which can be found under the handle @ramizlolas or on Tattoodo as @inkofcodes, showcases the precision and skill level that make him a standout tattoo artist in the industry.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Beit Jala, West Bank",
